Package: genflow
Type: Package
Title: Unified Cloud and Local Generative AI Workflows
Version: 0.0.8
Authors@R: person(
    given = "Hugo",
    family = "Rzepian Teixeira",
    email = "hugorteixeira@senhormercado.com.br",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides normalized workflows for text, image, speech-to-text,
    and text-to-speech generation across cloud APIs and local inference
    backends. Includes reusable agent configuration, parallel batches,
    checkpointing, model catalogs, diagnostics, statistics, validated portable
    bundles, and an interactive management application.
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Encoding: UTF-8
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
License: GPL (>= 3)
URL: https://github.com/hugorteixeira/genflow
BugReports: https://github.com/hugorteixeira/genflow/issues
SystemRequirements: FFmpeg and ffprobe (required for large-audio preparation,
    splitting, and duration validation; otherwise optional), CrispASR or
    moss-transcribe.cpp CLI (optional, for native speech-to-text inference)
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE, roclets = c("collate", "namespace", "rd"))
